            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima Yeroboamu yaayombeka Shekemu omu nsi y'ebibungo bya Efuraimu, yaatuurayo; ku haahingwireho ebiro, yaafurukayo, yaazingura Penueli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.25",
