        },
        {
          "text": " Atyo omugabe yaagira enaama y'okukora ebishushani bibiri by'enyana omu zaabu. Yaagira abantu ati: Nikiija kubarusya okuguma nimwinamuka Yerusaalemu. Imwe Baisraeli 'mwe, nimureebe baaruhanga baanyu abaabaihire omu nsi ya Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.28",
